{"seq":3,"slug":"query-processing","title":"查询处理与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/query-processing","wordCount":918,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询处理与优化\">查询处理与优化</h1><p>查询处理是搜索系统中将用户输入转化为有序结果的核心环节，涵盖查询解析、复杂查询执行、数值范围查询、相关性调控和两阶段 rescore。掌握 Elasticsearch 的查询 DSL 执行机制和调优手段，能显著提升搜索质量和系统性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>用户输入的自然语言查询需要经过解析，转化为结构化的查询对象。Lucene 的 <code>QueryParser</code> 支持多种查询语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Lucene 查询语法示例&#10;python AND web NOT java           → BooleanQuery(MUST python, MUST web, MUST_NOT java)&#10;title:python OR body:django       → MultiFieldQuery&#10;&quot;python tutorial&quot;                 → PhraseQuery(slop=0)&#10;&quot;python  tutorial&quot;~2              → PhraseQuery(slop=2, 允许2词间距)&#10;python~2                          → FuzzyQuery(maxEdits=2)&#10;price:[10 TO 100]                 → RangeQuery\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Lucene 查询语法示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>python AND web NOT java           → BooleanQuery(MUST python, MUST web, MUST_NOT java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>title:python OR body:django       → MultiFieldQuery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"python tutorial\"                 → PhraseQuery(slop=0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"python  tutorial\"~2              → PhraseQuery(slop=2, 允许2词间距)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>python~2                          → FuzzyQuery(maxEdits=2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>price:[10 TO 100]                 → RangeQuery</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Elasticsearch Query DSL</strong> 将查询结构化为 JSON，更易程序化构建：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;bool&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;must&quot;: [{ &quot;match&quot;: { &quot;body&quot;: &quot;python web&quot; } }, { &quot;range&quot;: { &quot;date&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: &quot;2024-01-01&quot; } } }],&#10;      &quot;should&quot;: [{ &quot;match&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: { &quot;query&quot;: &quot;python&quot;, &quot;boost&quot;: 3 } } }],&#10;      &quot;filter&quot;: [{ &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;status&quot;: &quot;published&quot; } }, { &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;language&quot;: &quot;zh&quot; } }],&#10;      &quot;must_not&quot;: [{ &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;tags&quot;: &quot;deprecated&quot; } }]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"must\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gte\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } } }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"should\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"boost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } } }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"published\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"language\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"must_not\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deprecated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>must vs filter 的关键区别</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句</th>\n<th>参与评分</th>\n<th>是否缓存</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>must</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>全文匹配，影响相关性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（bitset 缓存）</td>\n<td>结构化过滤（状态、分类、时间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>should</code></td>\n<td>是（可选）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>加分项，不强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>must_not</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>排除条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>性能关键原则</strong>：能放 <code>filter</code> 的条件绝不放 <code>must</code>，因为 filter 的结果会被缓存为 bitset，后续相同 filter 直接复用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bkd-tree-与数值范围查询\">BKD Tree 与数值范围查询</h2><p>Lucene 5.0 引入 <strong>BKD Tree（Block k-d Tree）</strong> 替代传统倒排索引处理数值型和地理位置数据，大幅提升范围查询性能。</p>\n<p><strong>原理</strong>：BKD Tree 是 k-d tree 的磁盘友好变体，将 N 维数值空间递归二分，每个叶节点对应一块连续的磁盘页（通常 512-1024 个点）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"price 范围 [10, 100] 的查询：&#10;  BKD Tree 遍历：&#10;    根节点：[0, 1000] → 包含目标范围，继续&#10;    左子节点：[0, 500] → 包含 [10,100]，继续&#10;    左左节点：[0, 250] → 包含 [10,100]，继续&#10;    叶节点：[0, 125] → 解码 doc_id 列表，过滤 price ∈ [10,100]&#10;&#10;  相比倒排索引：不需要为每个 price 值维护 posting list&#10;  范围查询复杂度：O(n^(1-1/k) + m)，n 为总文档数，m 为结果数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>price 范围 [10, 100] 的查询：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  BKD Tree 遍历：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    根节点：[0, 1000] → 包含目标范围，继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    左子节点：[0, 500] → 包含 [10,100]，继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    左左节点：[0, 250] → 包含 [10,100]，继续</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    叶节点：[0, 125] → 解码 doc_id 列表，过滤 price ∈ [10,100]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  相比倒排索引：不需要为每个 price 值维护 posting list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  范围查询复杂度：O(n^(1-1/k) + m)，n 为总文档数，m 为结果数</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数值字段类型对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>底层结构</th>\n<th>精确值查询</th>\n<th>范围查询</th>\n<th>聚合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>keyword</code>（字符串）</td>\n<td>倒排索引</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>Doc Values</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>integer/float</code></td>\n<td>BKD Tree</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>Doc Values</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>date</code></td>\n<td>BKD Tree</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>Doc Values</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"function-score-复合相关性调控\">Function Score：复合相关性调控</h2><p><code>function_score</code> 允许在 BM25 得分基础上叠加业务信号（权威性、时效性、个性化）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;function_score&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;match&quot;: { &quot;body&quot;: &quot;python tutorial&quot; } },&#10;      &quot;functions&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;filter&quot;: { &quot;term&quot;: { &quot;is_official&quot;: true } },&#10;          &quot;weight&quot;: 2.0&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;gauss&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;publish_date&quot;: {&#10;              &quot;origin&quot;: &quot;now&quot;,&#10;              &quot;scale&quot;: &quot;30d&quot;,&#10;              &quot;decay&quot;: 0.5&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;field_value_factor&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;field&quot;: &quot;pagerank_score&quot;,&#10;            &quot;modifier&quot;: &quot;log1p&quot;,&#10;            &quot;factor&quot;: 0.5&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;score_mode&quot;: &quot;sum&quot;,&#10;      &quot;boost_mode&quot;: &quot;multiply&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"function_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python tutorial\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"functions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"is_official\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"gauss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"publish_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"now\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              \"decay\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"field_value_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pagerank_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"modifier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"log1p\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"score_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"boost_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"multiply\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>衰减函数（Decay Functions）</strong> 用于时效性和距离加权：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph DecayTypes[衰减函数类型]&#10;        G[Gaussian\\n高斯衰减\\n平滑钟形]&#10;        E[Exponential\\n指数衰减\\n尾部更长]&#10;        L[Linear\\n线性衰减\\n均匀递减]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph DecayTypes[衰减函数类型]\n        G[Gaussian\\n高斯衰减\\n平滑钟形]\n        E[Exponential\\n指数衰减\\n尾部更长]\n        L[Linear\\n线性衰减\\n均匀递减]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>gauss</code></td>\n<td>钟形曲线，origin 处得分最高，双向对称衰减</td>\n<td>时效性（最近30天最佳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exp</code></td>\n<td>指数衰减，尾部更厚</td>\n<td>地理距离（距离越远指数衰减）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>linear</code></td>\n<td>线性衰减到 0</td>\n<td>价格区间，硬截止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>score_mode</strong>（多函数得分合并）：<code>multiply</code>（乘积）、<code>sum</code>（求和）、<code>max</code>、<code>avg</code>、<code>first</code>、<code>min</code></p>\n<p><strong>boost_mode</strong>（函数得分 vs 查询得分合并）：<code>multiply</code>（默认）、<code>replace</code>（完全替换）、<code>sum</code>、<code>avg</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"rescore-两阶段精排\">Rescore：两阶段精排</h2><p><code>rescore</code> 在初次查询的 Top-N 结果上执行代价更高的重排，实现两阶段排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;match&quot;: { &quot;body&quot;: &quot;python machine learning&quot; } },&#10;  &quot;rescore&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;window_size&quot;: 100,&#10;    &quot;query&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;rescore_query&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;function_score&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;match_phrase&quot;: { &quot;body&quot;: &quot;machine learning&quot; } },&#10;          &quot;boost&quot;: 4.0&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;query_weight&quot;: 0.7,&#10;      &quot;rescore_query_weight&quot;: 1.2&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python machine learning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rescore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rescore_query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"function_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match_phrase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"machine learning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"boost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rescore_query_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rescore 的最终得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>final_score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>query_score</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>rescore_score</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{final\\_score} = \\text{query\\_score} \\times 0.7 + \\text{rescore\\_score} \\times 1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">final_score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">query_score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rescore_score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>两阶段流水线设计</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Phase 1 (BM25 召回):&#10;  全量索引 → 快速召回 Top-1000&#10;  工具：bool query + filter 缓存优化&#10;&#10;Phase 2 (Rescore 精排):&#10;  Top-1000 → 高质量精排 → Top-10&#10;  工具：phrase query、slop、function_score、LTR（Learning to Rank）插件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 1 (BM25 召回):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  全量索引 → 快速召回 Top-1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  工具：bool query + filter 缓存优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 2 (Rescore 精排):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Top-1000 → 高质量精排 → Top-10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  工具：phrase query、slop、function_score、LTR（Learning to Rank）插件</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这与神经排序模型（第 2 章第 3 篇）的 <code>cascaded reranking</code> 思路一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询性能调优\">查询性能调优</h2><p><strong>Profile API 诊断</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;profile&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: {&quot;bool&quot;: {&quot;must&quot;: [...]}}&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 响应中 profile.shards[].searches[].query 显示：&#10;// - type: TermQuery / BooleanQuery / ...&#10;// - time: 各子查询耗时（ms）&#10;// - breakdown: create_weight / build_scorer / next_doc / score 细分\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"must\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 响应中 profile.shards[].searches[].query 显示：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - type: TermQuery / BooleanQuery / ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - time: 各子查询耗时（ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - breakdown: create_weight / build_scorer / next_doc / score 细分</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常见性能问题与修复</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>修复方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深翻页</td>\n<td><code>from=9000, size=10</code> 慢</td>\n<td>改用 <code>search_after</code> 游标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>must</code> 中放过滤条件</td>\n<td>Filter 无法缓存</td>\n<td>改为 <code>filter</code> 子句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wildcard</code> 前缀通配</td>\n<td><code>*python*</code> 全量扫描</td>\n<td>改用 edge n-gram 自动补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>script_score</code> 复杂脚本</td>\n<td>每文档执行一次</td>\n<td>预计算字段存入 Doc Values</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fielddata 排序/聚合</td>\n<td>text 字段 OOM</td>\n<td>用 <code>keyword</code> 子字段 + Doc Values</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>must vs filter</strong>：过滤条件放 <code>filter</code>（缓存为 bitset），只有相关性贡献才放 <code>must</code></li>\n<li><strong>BKD Tree</strong> 是数值/日期范围查询的底层结构，比倒排索引快 1-2 个数量级</li>\n<li><strong>function_score</strong> 将 BM25 得分与业务信号（权威性、时效性、PageRank）组合；Decay 函数处理时效/距离衰减</li>\n<li><strong>Rescore</strong> 实现两阶段精排：BM25 廉价召回 Top-1000，再用昂贵查询精排 Top-10</li>\n<li>性能调优优先用 <strong>Profile API</strong> 定位瓶颈，<code>search_after</code> 替代深翻页，避免 text 字段 <code>fielddata</code></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：搜索引擎架构（本章第 1 篇）提供 segment/缓存基础；分布式检索（本章第 2 篇）解释这些查询如何在多分片上执行；离线评测指标（第 4 章第 1 篇）帮助量化查询优化效果。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询处理与优化","id":"查询处理与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BKD Tree 与数值范围查询","id":"bkd-tree-与数值范围查询"},{"level":2,"text":"Function Score：复合相关性调控","id":"function-score-复合相关性调控"},{"level":2,"text":"Rescore：两阶段精排","id":"rescore-两阶段精排"},{"level":2,"text":"查询性能调优","id":"查询性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/distributed-retrieval"},"next":{"title":"离线评测指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/evaluation/offline-evaluation-metrics"}}